{"height": 13, "weight": 615, "base_experience": 175, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "defense", "value": 2}], "genus": "Ogre Scorpion Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "slow", "egg_groups": ["bug", "water3"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ドラピオン"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Dorapion"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "드래피온"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "龍王蠍"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Drascore"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Piondragi"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Drapion"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Drapion"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ドラピオン"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "龙王蝎"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Drapion"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["diamond", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "It has the power in its clawed arms to make scrap of a car. The tips of its claws release poison."}, {"versions": ["pearl"], "text": "Its body is encased in a sturdy shell. Its head rotates 180 degrees, eliminating blind spots."}, {"versions": ["platinum", "black", "white"], "text": "Possessing a sturdy build, it takes pride in its strength, taking down foes without using toxins."}, {"versions": ["heartgold", "soulsilver"], "text": "It attacks people and Pokémon that cross the desert. This has only furthered its bad reputation."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "It takes pride in its strength. Even though it can tear foes apart, it finishes them off with powerful poison."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "Its poison is potent, but it rarely sees use. This Pokémon prefers to use physical force instead, going on rampages with its car-crushing strength."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "It’s so vicious that it’s called the Sand Demon. Yet when confronted by Hippowdon, Drapion keeps a low profile and will never pick a fight."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "Has a brutish, ferocious temperament. With immense strength and a sturdy shell